"is_hurt": 0}, "340112": {"id": 340112, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|HK416_0|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"340101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "340102": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "340103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "340104": {"char_code": "HK416_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "Commander, you'll be by my side forever...right?"}, "340105": {"char_code": "HK416_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "Adults always have endless expectations for the new things around them...yet I don't have a choice."}, "340106": {"char_code": "HK416_0", "voice_key": "WIN", "caption": "Humph, this is what you get!"}, "340107": {"char_code": "HK416_0", "voice_key": "PHRASE", "caption": "Watch me."}, "340108": {"char_code": "HK416_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "Commander...although my current name is 416...I'd still be happy if you were to call me HKM4."}, "340109": {"char_code": "HK416_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Are you enjoying our time together, Commander? Although I still don't know what to do when I'm unhappy...I'm sure that as long as we work together, we'll definitely overcome any obstacle!"}, "340110": {"char_code": "HK416_0", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "To do this sort of thing... Have you already mentally prepared yourself?<>If I lose my name again someday in the future...you wouldn't feel regretful, right?<>I'm very afraid that I wouldn't be able to handle it if that were to happen...but I believe in your decision...<>Because I am 416...the one that loves you the most, Commander!"}, "340111": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "340112": {"char_code": "HK416_0", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Good morning, Commander. I won't lose to anyone today."}}}